  "source_code": "t= int(input())\r\nfor _ in range(t):\r\n    n = int(input())\r\n    ratings = list(map(int, input().split()))\r\n    ratings.sort(reverse = True)\r\n    arr = [0]\r\n    for rating in ratings:\r\n        arr.append(arr[-1] + rating)\r\n    best = 0\r\n    for a in range(n + 1):\r\n        m = n - a\r\n        base = 2 * arr[a]\r\n        s = 3 * n - 2 * a\r\n        low, high = 0, m\r\n        while low < high:\r\n            b = (low + high) // 2\r\n            g0 = arr[a + 2 * b] + 3 * arr[s-b]\r\n            g1 = arr[a + 2 * b + 2] + 3 * arr[s-b-1]\r\n            if g1 > g0:\r\n                low = b + 1\r\n            else:\r\n                high = b\r\n        v = base + arr[a + 2 * low] + 3 * arr[s-low]\r\n        if v > best:\r\n            best = v\r\n    print(best)",
